Package: com.r0gueee.origin
Name: Origin
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Maintainer: r0gueee <r0gueee@users.noreply.github.com>
Pre-Depends: firmware (>= 15.0.0)
Description: Manage APT sources on the device
 Origin reads and writes the sources files Sileo, Zebra and apt use, in both the
 one-line and the deb822 spelling, and shows you exactly what it is about to
 write before it writes it. Every change is snapshotted first and can be undone.
 .
 It never rewrites a line it was not asked to change, so comments, blank lines
 and fields it does not model survive an edit untouched.
 .
 One build covers both jailbreak layouts: on a rootless jailbreak everything
 lives under /var/jb, on a rootful one it does not. The two paths differ only in
 the engine's layout table, not in the binary.
Homepage: https://github.com/R0GUEEE/Origin
